# Exiling the dead enchanted creature before the trigger resolves prevents the return and the optional payment (CR 400.7, 603.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire x3
Ornithopter
Puppet Master
Tormod's Crypt
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Tormod's Crypt.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Puppet Master.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
